m/v/t64.5771-25/491824318_27292244040449194_3509206164409486334_n.png?_nc_cat=105&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=LEyv16vjZTcQ7kNvwFDTNTQ&_nc_oc=AdpYmaB6X3smk5i9kjHBOLqEu1Z0zOQyz-0mejOVjvdU9_6OWefZW6fKFBvz54Jwmws&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQRm_tsxd6P2yW9mUtElftoIm-WbNv9lduuTtNLFHregwg&oe=6AFB1A33"}, {"file_name": "Screenshots01.png", "id": "1109337971748811", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491825257_1109337975082144_2868233776751948265_n.png?_nc_cat=100&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=uBlxfmavqt4Q7kNvwFIgfRX&_nc_oc=Adq_RkIdUPrhVOxxiBzkz-e1HlNqRVxhO4fDoMfJBCa-5JZ0htl2TRMmCMAC1hk-0BM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQNdb8tbvLxRc9jr_vqBNKMcRsiw-cCQHwgtIIlH2OFkg&oe=6AFB490B"}, {"file_name": "Screenshots07.png", "id": "1384542647199119", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491823310_1384542650532452_1440589814285122188_n.png?_nc_cat=108&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=SNu6g2JGVTQQ7kNvwG8vU_j&_nc_oc=AdqOiBQP9ltrOjKmksS6c23_79y-Gf2z__cDCXO6gopGpM0ndurg-8K_JCxiyiT8lxU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQd8LE38cVz98rY2hgrUM9WLDsxAFTUSUNuue30GqTCGg&oe=6AFB2384"}, {"file_name": "Screenshots02.png", "id": "1400532592047808", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491823940_1400532595381141_3399314511837708075_n.png?_nc_cat=104&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=jQxSVh0EtTkQ7kNvwHMaXlc&_nc_oc=AdrZcNBMp_-hrS18zc09cbG3iqHvG48IGdP2IIXMGybdfUgskUHkzXKoIEctsoLuJ1M&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQRskdHOhUkYq-36zq7IUM0N9mmf4lpI0K6JIyI0JA93RA&oe=6AFB27D6"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "2560x1440_s logom.png", "id": "985519041223669", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491825257_985519044557002_3272235211507795905_n.png?_nc_cat=108&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=VWXLmEcQS2UQ7kNvwEl3Cj_&_nc_oc=AdoYNOJCYnVyDw0lgz5cF94-YkLweFOxHd9_TpwpfgzFv_hjpsP01lBWY0QwX-QuAec&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQ-Brf3zUCzlm6b6wCONh_daJekWhrVZ9XlWypJ9P3I3A&oe=6AFB2F50"}, "display_name": "Control Freek", "keywords": ["Reflex", "Speed", "Buttons", "Challenge", "Time"], "long_description": "# OPERATORS WANTED!\n\nWe are looking for new hands to join the assembling team of the HAPPY ITEMS CORPORATION (HI-CORP\u00ae) and race for maximum effectivity!\n\nYour task will be to control the HI-Console\u00ae and keep the HI-CORP\u00ae production line running. In other words: Press. Flick. Push. Pull. Levers. Cranks. Buttons. Switches.\n\nExecute each sequence in the correct and timely order to manufacture a certified HAPPY ITEM\u00ae. Successful completion resets the line: an infinite loop of productivity, purpose, and joy!\n\nYour duties:\n- Master increasingly complex variations of the HI-Console\u00ae controls\n- Outperform your Co-Operators on the global leaderboards and become Operator of the Month\n- Share one headset in Party Mode: colleagues, relatives and houseguests take turns at the HI-Console\u00ae, and every level keeps a local leaderboard so they can be ranked, compared, judged and thus motivated to improve\n- Operate to the sound of our tailor-composed HI-CORP\u00ae soundtrack, engineered for maximum joy\n- Most importantly: always have fun!\n\nAre you ready to push some levers and limits?\n\nHI-CORP\u00ae\nHuman Resource & Joy Management\n", "short_description": "Junior Operators wanted! Master the HI-Console\u00ae!\n\nA VR arcade game of pulling, flicking, and pressing analogue controls\nin fast, precise sequences to keep the HI-CORP\u00ae production line running.\n\nSpeed up, skill up and become Operator of the Month!"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.fono-labs.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/contro